# An allowlist: everything is out of the build context, and only what the image
# is built from comes back in.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src
!deploy/speech.toml
!packages/client/pyproject.toml
!packages/client/src
!providers/provider-contract/pyproject.toml
!providers/provider-contract/src

# The source trees above are admitted whole, so what a working tree grows inside
# them stays out: nested repositories, environments and tool caches.
**/.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.*_cache
**/node_modules
